      "title": "None return breaks order_total and tax_line callers",
      "description": "tax_for now returns None for an unknown region. order_total in shop/checkout.py adds that result to an int, and tax_line in shop/receipt.py divides it by 100. Checkout and receipt printing raise TypeError for every order from an unknown region. Before this change, those orders went through with zero tax. Update order_total and tax_line to handle a None result. Otherwise, keep returning 0 for unknown regions.",
